  "note": "Previously unstated prerequisite. This module specializes the existing StageSystem.PairCategory to the actual rational scalar-extension functors with their normalized tensor associators. It supplies canonical Hom-colimit coordinates, stagewise shifts, image triangles and the common-stage Verdier structure, with independent closure and scheme universes and no Karoubi completion."
